{"type": "file", "p": "Space Invaders (19xx)(-).zip", "n": "Space Invaders (19xx)(-)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/tosec-20161111-commodore-pet/TOSEC.2016.11.11.Commodore.PET.AlphaBot.zip/TOSEC.2016.11.11.Commodore.PET.AlphaBot%2FCommodore%20PET%20-%20Games%2FSpace%20Invaders%20%2819xx%29%28-%29.zip", "size": "4.44 KB", "size_bytes": 4546}], "meta": {"path": "./Space Invaders (19xx)(-).zip", "name": "Space Invaders", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 4.44 KB\n\nThis conversion of Space Invaders stays very true to the original despite being written in BASIC. Game play is exactly the same with the player in control of a tank at the bottom of the screen firing at advancing aliens. The aliens fire back and the player can take cover behind bunkers. The bunkers give way a little bit easier than in the arcade version due to fewer pixels. The sound also tries to stay true to the original with the ever increasing speed of the beat when the aliens draw nearer.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/images/Space Invaders (19xx)(-)-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/images/Space Invaders (19xx)(-)-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/images/Space Invaders (19xx)(-)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/videos/Space Invaders (19xx)(-)-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/images/Space Invaders (19xx)(-)-boxback.png", "releasedate": "19830101T000000", "developer": "Chris Smeets", "publisher": "Keypunch Software", "genre": "Shoot'em Up / Vertical", "players": "1", "md5": "df67bffce34074fe6bec541d0f26cc71", "family": "Space Invaders", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 4546, "size": "4.44 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Space Invaders (19xx)(-)[b].zip", "n": "Space Invaders (19xx)(-)[b]", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/tosec-20161111-commodore-pet/TOSEC.2016.11.11.Commodore.PET.AlphaBot.zip/TOSEC.2016.11.11.Commodore.PET.AlphaBot%2FCommodore%20PET%20-%20Games%2FSpace%20Invaders%20%2819xx%29%28-%29%5Bb%5D.zip", "size": "4.00 KB", "size_bytes": 4096}], "meta": {"path": "./Space Invaders (19xx)(-)[b].zip", "name": "Space Invaders", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 4.00 KB\n\nThis conversion of Space Invaders stays very true to the original despite being written in BASIC. Game play is exactly the same with the player in control of a tank at the bottom of the screen firing at advancing aliens. The aliens fire back and the player can take cover behind bunkers. The bunkers give way a little bit easier than in the arcade version due to fewer pixels. The sound also tries to stay true to the original with the ever increasing speed of the beat when the aliens draw nearer.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/images/Space Invaders (19xx)(-)[b]-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/images/Space Invaders (19xx)(-)[b]-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/images/Space Invaders (19xx)(-)[b]-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/videos/Space Invaders (19xx)(-)[b]-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/images/Space Invaders (19xx)(-)[b]-boxback.png", "releasedate": "19830101T000000", "developer": "Chris Smeets", "publisher": "Keypunch Software", "genre": "Shoot'em Up / Vertical", "players": "1", "md5": "2d28423e28380166cdb4a8b221a4f338", "family": "Space Invaders", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 4096, "size": "4.00 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Space War (19xx)(-).zip", "n": "Space War (19xx)(-)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/tosec-20161111-commodore-pet/TOSEC.2016.11.11.Commodore.PET.AlphaBot.zip/TOSEC.2016.11.11.Commodore.PET.AlphaBot%2FCommodore%20PET%20-%20Games%2FSpace%20War%20%2819xx%29%28-%29.zip", "size": "2.67 KB", "size_bytes": 2734}], "meta": {"path": "./Space War (19xx)(-).zip", "name": "Space War", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 2.67 KB\n\nIn Space War you control a spaceship at the bottom of the screen and defend yourself against attacking UFOs. The enemies appear above and move across the screen while trying to hit you. Using your laser you shoot the alien ships to destroy them and earn points. Missed shots or enemies that slip through are counted, so you must eliminate as many attackers as possible before they become overwhelming. The gameplay follows the classic Space Invaders style and requires quick reflexes and good timing.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/images/Space War (19xx)(-)-image.png", "releasedate": "19860101T000000", "developer": "Robtek", "publisher": "Robtek", "genre": "Disparos / Tipo Space Invaders", "players": "1", "md5": "2d63f0e8f9e1a6543ac394afebe050f5", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 2734, "size": "2.67 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Star Wars (19xx)(-)[b].zip", "n": "Star Wars (19xx)(-)[b]", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/tosec-20161111-commodore-pet/TOSEC.2016.11.11.Commodore.PET.AlphaBot.zip/TOSEC.2016.11.11.Commodore.PET.AlphaBot%2FCommodore%20PET%20-%20Games%2FStar%20Wars%20%2819xx%29%28-%29%5Bb%5D.zip", "size": "4.02 KB", "size_bytes": 4116}], "meta": {"path": "./Star Wars (19xx)(-)[b].zip", "name": "Star Wars", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 4.02 KB\n\nStar Wars brings the arcade classic to the C64, letting you relive the film's most iconic moments. Across three stages that repeat with increasing difficulty, you first battle in space, then fight your way across the Death Star's surface, and finally attempt the legendary trench run. The goal is to endure as long as possible, because once your shield energy is depleted, the game is over.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/images/Star Wars (19xx)(-)[b]-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/images/Star Wars (19xx)(-)[b]-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/images/Star Wars (19xx)(-)[b]-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/videos/Star Wars (19xx)(-)[b]-video.mp4", "fanart": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/images/Star Wars (19xx)(-)[b]-fanart.jpg", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/pet/images/Star Wars (19xx)(-)[b]-boxback.png", "releasedate": "19880101T000000", "developer": "Vektor Grafix", "publisher": "Domark", "genre": "Disparos / Avión, 1ª persona", "players": "1", "md5": "582cc623a6d5d47248fc65ef90a467e5", "family": "Star Wars", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 4116, "size": "4.02 KB"}
